<div class="box-highlight">
    <strong>Visi Sistem:</strong> Mengintegrasikan seluruh siklus manufaktur percetakan offset &amp; flexo packaging &mdash; mulai dari penawaran harga, pengadaan bahan baku, produksi 4 tahap, pengiriman, pengelolaan SDM &amp; penggajian, pengajuan biaya (NPB/LPJ), hingga terbitnya 6 Laporan Keuangan PSAK secara otomatis, presisi, dan <em>auditable</em>.
</div>

<h2>1.1 Tiga Pilar Penyelarasan &amp; Dashboard Eksekutif</h2>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 24%;">Komponen Asal</th>
            <th style="width: 34%;">Karakteristik &amp; Keunggulan</th>
            <th style="width: 42%;">Implementasi di TTC Enterprise ERP v3.0</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Bismillah MACRO.xlsm</strong></td>
            <td>Data riil sales order percetakan, perhitungan titipan harga (<em>adjustment unit</em>), komisi marketing 2%, dan voucher komisi.</td>
            <td>Terintegrasi penuh pada modul <em>Operasional &amp; Sales Commission</em>, Invoice, dan jurnal otomatis akun <code>6101</code> (Beban Komisi Penjualan).</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Sistem Indigama 02</strong></td>
            <td>Standar ERP manufaktur percetakan: Approval Form, OC, SPK, 115 Master COA, Analisa Laba Rugi Mesin, dan Payroll Borongan.</td>
            <td>Seluruh 115 COA Indigama, alur produksi 4 tahap, format laporan keuangan (termasuk Laba Rugi per Mesin), dan skema borongan diadopsi presisi.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>TTC Modern Laravel 10 + Filament 3</strong></td>
            <td>Antarmuka modern responsif, keamanan RBAC (Filament Shield), database MariaDB/MySQL relasional, dan ekspor DomPDF server-side.</td>
            <td>Dilengkapi <strong>Dashboard Eksekutif</strong> (KPI bisnis, grafik Sales vs Purchase bulanan, filter tahun), tema kontras tinggi <em>dark-mode &amp; print-safe</em>, serta menu Finance &amp; HRD yang diringkas.</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>1.2 Peta Struktur Sidebar Aktif (14 Grup Navigasi Terintegrasi)</h2>
<p>Untuk memudahkan operasional harian tanpa penumpukan sub-menu, seluruh fitur sistem dikelompokkan dalam 14 grup navigasi dengan penggabungan menu transaksional pada grup <strong>Pra Cetak</strong>, <strong>Finance</strong>, dan <strong>HRD</strong>:</p>

<table class="data-table">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;" class="text-center">No</th>
            <th style="width: 20%;">Grup Navigasi</th>
            <th style="width: 11%;" class="text-center">Menu Tampil</th>
            <th style="width: 64%;">Cakupan Sub-Modul &amp; Fokus Operasional</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td class="text-center">1</td><td><strong>Marketing</strong></td><td class="text-center">5</td><td>Master Customer, Approval Form (BOM FG), Finish Good Item, Order Confirmation (HPP Flexo &amp; Plate), Sales Order.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">2</td><td><strong>Purchase</strong></td><td class="text-center">10</td><td>Purchase Request (PR), Multi-Supplier PO Auto-Split, Master Item/Supplier/Satuan/Konversi, External &amp; Internal Return.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">3</td><td><strong>PPIC</strong></td><td class="text-center">2</td><td>Master Proses Produksi, Master Surat Perintah Kerja (SPK) dengan autofill spesifikasi teknis dari OC.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">4</td><td><strong>Subcount</strong></td><td class="text-center">2</td><td>Subcount Out (khusus SPK Maklon/Subcount) &amp; Subcount In (penerimaan hasil subkontraktor).</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">5</td><td><strong>Pra Cetak</strong></td><td class="text-center"><span class="badge badge-blue">3 Ringkas</span></td><td>Proses Pra Cetak (KPI &amp; grafik inline), Material &amp; Stok Plate Flexo (deduksi fraksional), Arsip &amp; Rak Plate (repeat order).</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">6</td><td><strong>Printing</strong></td><td class="text-center">5</td><td>Laporan Printing, IMR Printing, Master Mesin, Master Operator, Master Note Waste (pencatatan qty kerusakan).</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">7</td><td><strong>Die Making</strong></td><td class="text-center">4</td><td>Laporan Die Making, IMR Die Making (terhubung SPK BOM &amp; Issue Warehouse), Master Mesin, Master Operator.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">8</td><td><strong>Finishing</strong></td><td class="text-center">5</td><td>Laporan Finishing, Packaging (satuan penuh/sisa &amp; buffer stock), IMR Finish, Master Mesin, Master Operator.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">9</td><td><strong>Dispatch</strong></td><td class="text-center">3</td><td>Surat Jalan (kunci anti-double invoice), Berita Acara Complaint, Modul Blokir Customer.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">10</td><td><strong>Warehouse</strong></td><td class="text-center">6</td><td>Penerimaan Barang (LPB), Pengeluaran Material (Issue), Stok &amp; History Material, Stok &amp; History Finish Good.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">11</td><td><strong>Finance</strong></td><td class="text-center"><span class="badge badge-green">10 Inti</span></td><td>Invoice &amp; Piutang, Tagihan &amp; Bayar PO, NPB &amp; LPJ, Kas, Bank, Operasional &amp; Komisi, Jurnal Memorial, General Ledger, Sinkron Finance-HRD, Master COA.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">12</td><td><strong>HRD</strong></td><td class="text-center"><span class="badge badge-purple">8 Inti</span></td><td>Dashboard HRD, Karyawan 360&deg; &amp; Kontrak, Absensi (Cut-Off 26-25), Izin/Cuti/Lembur, Penggajian, Payroll Borongan, Pinjaman, Pengaturan Shift &amp; Payroll.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">13</td><td><strong>Report</strong></td><td class="text-center">3</td><td>Report Finance (6 Laporan dalam Tab Terpadu + PDF), Report Produksi, Report PO vs PB.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="text-center">14</td><td><strong>Manajemen Akses</strong></td><td class="text-center">1</td><td>Pengguna &amp; Role/Permission berbasis Filament Shield untuk isolasi data lintas departemen.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

