<h2>2.1 Diagram Alur Besar Lintas Departemen (Order-to-Cash &amp; Back-Office)</h2>
<p>Diagram berikut memetakan hubungan data otomatis dari pesanan masuk hingga laporan keuangan manajemen (kode diagram Mermaid siap tempel juga tersedia di <code>flowchart_sistem_erp_ttc.mmd</code>):</p>

<table class="flow-grid">
    <tr>
        <td style="width: 23%;">
            <div class="fnode">
                <strong>1. MARKETING</strong>
                Customer &rarr; Approval Form &rarr; OC (DP &amp; HPP) &rarr; Sales Order (SO)
            </div>
        </td>
        <td class="farrow">&rarr;</td>
        <td style="width: 23%;">
            <div class="fnode">
                <strong>2. PPIC</strong>
                Master Proses &rarr; Terbitkan SPK (Autofill Spek OC &amp; BOM)
            </div>
        </td>
        <td class="farrow">&rarr;</td>
        <td style="width: 23%;">
            <div class="fnode amber">
                <strong>3. PURCHASE &amp; GUDANG</strong>
                PR &rarr; Multi-Supplier PO &rarr; LPB &rarr; Stok &amp; Issue Material
            </div>
        </td>
        <td class="farrow">&rarr;</td>
        <td style="width: 23%;">
            <div class="fnode amber">
                <strong>4. PRODUKSI 4 TAHAP</strong>
                Pra Cetak &rarr; Printing &rarr; Die Making (&harr; Subcount) &rarr; Finishing
            </div>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td colspan="6"></td>
        <td class="farrow-down">&darr;</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>
            <div class="fnode green">
                <strong>8. REPORT MANAJEMEN</strong>
                6 Laporan Keuangan PSAK, Report Produksi &amp; PO vs PB
            </div>
        </td>
        <td class="farrow">&larr;</td>
        <td>
            <div class="fnode green">
                <strong>7. FINANCE (10 MENU)</strong>
                Invoice, Tagihan PO, NPB/LPJ, Kas/Bank, GL &amp; Sync HRD
            </div>
        </td>
        <td class="farrow">&larr;</td>
        <td>
            <div class="fnode purple">
                <strong>6. HRD v2 (8 MENU)</strong>
                Karyawan 360&deg;, Absensi 26-25, Approval, Payroll &amp; Borongan
            </div>
        </td>
        <td class="farrow">&larr;</td>
        <td>
            <div class="fnode">
                <strong>5. DISPATCH &amp; FG</strong>
                Stok Finish Good &rarr; Cek Blokir &rarr; Surat Jalan (&amp; Complaint)
            </div>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
<div style="text-align: center; font-size: 7.8px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 8px;">
    <em>Catatan integrasi:</em> Surat Jalan (5) langsung memicu Invoice di Finance (7); LPB Gudang (3) memicu Tagihan PO di Finance (7); Penggajian &amp; BPJS HRD (6) terhubung 2 arah ke NPB/LPJ &amp; Jurnal PSAK di Finance (7).
</div>

<h2>2.2 Ringkasan 8 Tahap Alur Bisnis Utama</h2>
<div class="flow-step">
    <span class="step-num">1</span> <strong>MARKETING &amp; PRE-ORDER:</strong>
    Master Customer &amp; Finish Good &rarr; Approval Form (Set BOM) &rarr; Order Confirmation (Kalkulator HPP Flexo, DP, TOP) &rarr; Sales Order (SO).
</div>
<div class="flow-step amber">
    <span class="step-num amber">2</span> <strong>PROCURE-TO-PAY (PURCHASE &amp; WAREHOUSE):</strong>
    Cek stok bahan &rarr; Jika kurang buat PR &rarr; Multi-Supplier PO Auto-Split &rarr; Terima di LPB (plate otomatis masuk stok Prepress) &rarr; External Return bila rusak &rarr; Issue Material ke produksi &amp; Internal Return sisa bahan.
</div>
<div class="flow-step amber">
    <span class="step-num amber">3</span> <strong>PPIC &amp; PRODUKSI 4 TAHAP + SUBCOUNT:</strong>
    Terbit SPK &rarr; <strong>Pra Cetak</strong> (ambil/buat Plate dari Rak Arsip via IMR) &rarr; <strong>Printing</strong> (IMR Printing, catat hasil baik &amp; waste) &rarr; <strong>Die Making</strong> (IMR Die Making) &rarr; <em>Subcount Out/In (jika perlu)</em> &rarr; <strong>Finishing &amp; Packaging</strong> (unit fleksibel &amp; buffer stock).
</div>
<div class="flow-step">
    <span class="step-num">4</span> <strong>WAREHOUSE FINISH GOOD &amp; DISPATCH:</strong>
    Hasil jadi masuk Finish Good Stock &amp; History &rarr; Cek status Blokir Customer &rarr; Terbit Surat Jalan (Driver &amp; Armada) &rarr; Berita Acara Complaint bila ada retur/klaim.
</div>
<div class="flow-step green">
    <span class="step-num green">5</span> <strong>FINANCE: INVOICING, TAGIHAN PO &amp; KAS/BANK:</strong>
    Tarik Surat Jalan ke Invoice (PPN 11% / Non-PPN) &rarr; Catat pembayaran di Tab Invoice &rarr; Hitung Sales Commission 2% &bull; Tarik LPB ke Tagihan PO &rarr; Catat Payment Order di Tab PO Billing &rarr; Posting otomatis Double-Entry ke General Ledger.
</div>
<div class="flow-step green">
    <span class="step-num green">6</span> <strong>FINANCE: NPB, APPROVAL OWNER &amp; LPJ:</strong>
    Buat NPB (tarik saldo Kas/Bank &amp; pos HRD) &rarr; Approval Owner (penuh/parsial, misal 100 jt &rarr; ACC 80 jt) &rarr; Input Bank Masuk manual di menu Bank &rarr; Realisasi belanja &rarr; Penyelesaian NPB (LPJ) + upload bukti (mode Tracking Anti-Dobel / Auto-Journal Talangan 2144).
</div>
<div class="flow-step purple">
    <span class="step-num purple">7</span> <strong>HRD v2 &amp; SINKRONISASI FINANCE &harr; HRD:</strong>
    Master Karyawan 360&deg; (Shift &amp; Kontrak 1B/3B/6B/1T/Manual) &rarr; Absensi Fingerprint Cut-Off 26&ndash;25 &rarr; Approval Izin/Cuti/Lembur/Pinjaman &rarr; Penggajian (Generate Otomatis / Import Excel TTC / Borongan) &rarr; Command Center Sync ke Jurnal PSAK &amp; NPB/LPJ.
</div>
<div class="flow-step teal">
    <span class="step-num teal">8</span> <strong>PELAPORAN EKSEKUTIF (REPORT):</strong>
    General Ledger &rarr; Laba Rugi Global (Multi-Step), Laba Rugi per Mesin Cetak, Neraca Skontro 100% Balance, Trial Balance, Laporan Hutang &amp; Piutang (+ Kasbon HRD), Report Produksi, dan Report PO vs PB.
</div>

<div class="page-break"></div>

